  "request": "Tier 2 of RM24-i18n-translations (ticket MAG-8). Build the gateway i18n foundation: translation catalogue for es (default) and en, per-request language resolution (accounts.language for signed-in via tier 1's port, `lang` cookie for anonymous, falling back to es), the navbar globe-icon language selector visible on every page including login, an htmx switch that does not disrupt the current page, the layout/nav shell translated as the gold standard, and the AGENTS.md rule requiring EN+ES for every newly added label.",
